      "updated": 1781882793844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Insert a node at Kth position\n\n    Node* insertAtKth(Node* head,int k,int val){\n\n\n        // reach to k-1\n        save temp = ptr->next;\n        ptr->next = new Node(val)\n        ptr->next->next = temp;\n        return head;\n    }",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Insert a node at Kth position\n\n    Node* insertAtKth(Node* head,int k,int val){\n\n\n        // reach to k-1\n        save temp = ptr->next;\n        ptr->next = new Node(val)\n        ptr->next->next = temp;\n        return head;\n    }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
