      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) Delete a Node in linked List\n\nNode* deleteANode(Node* nodeToDelete){\n\n    node->val = node->next->val;\n    temp = node->next;\n    node->next  = node->next->next\n    delete temp\n\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) Delete a Node in linked List\n\nNode* deleteANode(Node* nodeToDelete){\n\n    node->val = node->next->val;\n    temp = node->next;\n    node->next  = node->next->next\n    delete temp\n\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
